  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n95 ÷ 15 - 34 ÷ {18 - 4 ÷ (3 × 12) × 9} × 2\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9dc39efa9ed4f0e8f3a13804d9cd35a57480c17ba618ddcb102c34a0474acd66.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n95 ÷ 15 - 34 ÷ {18 - 4 ÷ (3 × 12) × 9} × 2\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 15 - 34 ÷ {18 - 4 ÷ 36 × 9} × 2\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 15 - 34 ÷ {18 - 1/9 × 9} × 2\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 15 - 34 ÷ {18 - 1} × 2\n\n⇒ 95 ÷ 15 - 34 ÷ 17 × 2\n\n⇒ 19/3 - 2 × 2\n\n⇒ 19/3 - 4\n\n⇒ (19 - 12)/3\n\n⇒ 7/3 = 2 frac{{1}}{{3}}\n\n**∴ Required answer is 2 frac{{1}}{{3}}**",
